Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫葛利德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看起来好像早就认识我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,葛利德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,马上给我关闭迷宫 并且乖乖投降
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就饶你一条小命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 我为什么要听你的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你派到镇上的魔物全都被我们消灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到我们的战力了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,居然又派了那么多魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,路德 你冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我要冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,光靠你派出去的那些战力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是不可能击溃阿凡锡亚的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是能用近乎无限的点数 不断召唤魔物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,攻下那里只是时间的问题罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会先把你打倒 并且破坏掉这个迷宫！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事让我一直很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是人造人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,露娜小姐也是人造人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是有点感动罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟在我过去的研究中 从没看过像你这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,成长得这么出色的人造人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到在外面生活 居然能带给人造人这种影响
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,想不想回到我身边啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人只有路德大人一个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,露娜、路德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么瞒着我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一直瞒着你们真的很抱…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,之后要好好跟我们说明喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我干脆把一切都夺过来好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不是很喜欢这副模样的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好沉重的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不过只要用魔力强化全身的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,萨米弥娜 快退下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才是帮我挡下了护盾的损伤吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错 -你不必这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我这条命是用来拯救所有人造人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以把我当作 用完就丢的武器使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能打倒葛利德 你是生是死都无所谓吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那你不准参加这场战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不希望有人因此牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是人造人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就没有生命！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,葛利德只把你们当道具使用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样是想让我变成 你们最讨厌的那种人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就不要为了战斗 牺牲自己的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还有闲情逸致在这里聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-魔法防护罩！ -魔法防护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小伎俩还挺多的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,挑衅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是技能吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨人厌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:05:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你的魔法无效化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的胆子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,混账 你们竟敢这样对我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 快放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,力量被…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,难道这手铐是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,生命爆发！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,勇者大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别松懈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以给我有自信一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-是 -是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,亚蒙小姐 请你也一起来战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我已经累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,人家可不喜欢太烦人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,玛妮西娅大人说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个超甜的甜甜圈 是要做给努力战斗的亚蒙小姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要我跟她说你没在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不用准备甜甜圈了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒是早点说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没说自己不战斗喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的眷属们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,回归黑暗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,恰特魔法巴尔努瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 拜托你不要连城镇都一并毁掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们也带着葛利德回镇上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,魔王的胸口有这种魔石吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这股魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,强到无法和过去的对手相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是本尊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我按照自己的 记忆和能力做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那个人造人姑且也算本尊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不过战斗力好像做得太弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫葛利德
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这种客套话应该就免了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我们很快就要说再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这个攻击速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是轻轻动一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就能使出这么强的威力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,必须用魔力更加强化自己 否则无法打败他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看来无法用攻击亚蒙的那招对付他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-技能 融合 -技能 融合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 就这样继续攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,觉悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,萨米弥娜小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人重整态势
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,护盾被消耗掉了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我来引开他的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你帮路德回复护盾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是莉莉亚莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对上葛利德也只能一个劲地防守啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看来只能抓准时机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,用强力的攻击一招干掉他了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不然感觉没有胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,挑衅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,目前累积的伤害是两万点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就用这招一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,生命转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,露娜、萨米弥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-把她们带去妮恩那边 -是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这边莉莉亚和莉莉都无法战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办才好？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的魔力强化程度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在力量和速度方面都没有胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要将更多…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,将更多的魔力注入全身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一击就把我的护盾耗尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这样就能再用一次生命转换了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,让魔力在全身流动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这次一定要用尽所有力量干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,生命转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,护盾碎了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就算注入魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也痛到无法动弹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-露娜小姐、妮恩小姐 快到我身后 -我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:13:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-被葛利德的攻击打飞了吗？ -露娜也快点过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,萨米弥娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-得快点… -可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,得快点去救大家才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法顺利使出魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大家的护盾…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都耗尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,露娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去露娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,以及大家都会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快动起来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有魔力全部流入身体里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别管身上那些疼痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,突破自己的极限吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个队伍的肉盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,路德？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,路德？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-脑中一直有个声音 -破坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-要我把一切破坏殆尽 -破坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让更多魔力在全身流动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要一直打到这家伙不能再战斗为止
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一直打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一直打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他人在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,得一并破坏掉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快清醒过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,妮恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我稍微用魔法打了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？清醒过来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才好像被魔力吞噬了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才会丧失自我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力又擅自…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是要学会控制
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法控制魔力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就会变成魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那个声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前好像也在哪里听过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,原来那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会变成魔物 最终失控
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,必须控制住魔力才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,路德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,妮恩 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏有你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能顺利控制住魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可不是被魔力吞噬的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须保护大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,葛利德！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要守护的地方已经完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他们和你们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一个不留地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,从这个世上排除！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,妮恩 我想请你帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来不断对我施展回复魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一刻都不能停下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想将一切全都赌在这一击上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这个请求很乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今 你还在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是你这个队伍的补师喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,放手去做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,再撑一下就好 大家别放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,生命爆发！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,想碰到我 你还早了一百年呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这边有一把新做好的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快点拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请让那边的人优先治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,多拿一些绷带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,葛利德
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是多亏了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,冒险者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,自警团
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人造人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,玛里乌斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,亚蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟大家待在同个空间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的技能就能辨识到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,牺牲之盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,身体好像突然变轻了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,护盾不会减少了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,路德的技能？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,葛利德
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你让我看到阿凡锡亚的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能把这个空间里 所有人的护盾损伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,全部转移到自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,身为最强肉盾的我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会守住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,生命转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是路德吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,玛妮西娅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:19:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直相信你绝对会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是每次都回来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说得也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了 玛妮西娅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,路德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,玛里乌斯、亚蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因为数量实在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法像你那样 顾到所有地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但还是勉强把城镇守住了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们两位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-路德！ -路德！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的在这么短的时间内 攻破迷宫啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,各位…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏有你们帮忙守护城镇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才能成功破坏迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,路德先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,路德果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-是最强肉盾！ -是最强肉盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我 路德的职业是肉盾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是讲述身为队伍盾职的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,摇身一变成为主角
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今后也会为了守护一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而努力奋斗的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.39,0:23:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,字幕翻译：柯欣冉
